+  // THE PRECONDITION IS READ, NOT ASSUMED. The coarse tape (T9-W7 3C-4) rises on a tapped peer
+  // digit in WebKit; in Chromium `hasTouch` it did not rise at all in pass 4, on the HEAD control
+  // (74a2b5d9) exactly as on this tree (0 of 25 samples over 1.2 s, seven cells). That is the
+  // fold's row, not this one; where the tape never rose, the "no tape under the sheet" clause
+  // below is vacuous, and the annotation says so rather than the row passing silently.
